        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) Employees will be eligible to vacation with pay during the current calendar year in accordance with Paragraphs 1(a)(1) through 1(a)(5) and subsequent provisions of this Article:",
            "block_bbox": [
                374,
                199,
                906,
                255
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    374.0,
                    199.0
                ],
                [
                    906.0,
                    199.0
                ],
                [
                    906.0,
                    255.0
                ],
                [
                    374.0,
                    255.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) One (1) week after completion of a Term of Employment of six (6) months.",
            "block_bbox": [
                405,
                258,
                906,
                296
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    405.0,
                    258.0
                ],
                [
                    906.0,
                    258.0
                ],
                [
                    906.0,
                    296.0
                ],
                [
                    405.0,
                    296.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) Two (2) weeks after completion of a Term of Employment of twelve (12) months, provided that if a Term of Employment of six (6) months and of twelve (12) months are both completed in the same calendar year, only two (2) weeks of vacation will be granted, with the second (2nd) week to be scheduled after completion of twelve (12) months' Term of Employment. The first (1st) week may be scheduled any time after completion of six (6) months' Term of Employment.",
            "block_bbox": [
                405,
                300,
                907,
                442
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    405.0,
                    300.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    300.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    442.0
                ],
                [
                    405.0,
                    442.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) Three (3) weeks beginning with the year in which a Term of Employment of seven (7) years will be completed.",
            "block_bbox": [
                405,
                447,
                907,
                486
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    405.0,
                    447.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    447.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    486.0
                ],
                [
                    405.0,
                    486.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) Four (4) weeks beginning with the year in which a Term of Employment of fifteen (15) years will be completed.",
            "block_bbox": [
                405,
                489,
                907,
                527
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    405.0,
                    489.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    489.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    527.0
                ],
                [
                    405.0,
                    527.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(5) Five (5) weeks beginning with the year in which a Term of Employment of twenty-five (25) years will be completed.",
            "block_bbox": [
                406,
                531,
                907,
                569
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    406.0,
                    531.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    531.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    569.0
                ],
                [
                    406.0,
                    569.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) The weeks of vacation provided for in Paragraph 1(a) will each consist of the number of days and hours which the Employee would have been scheduled to work (excluding overtime) during the vacation absence, except that an Employee whose Scheduled Weekly Tour (excluding overtime) is four and one-half (4 1/2) days per week, or alternating five- and four-day weeks, shall be eligible to fourteen (14) days and twenty-three (23) days, respectively, when Term of Employment is at least seven (7) and twenty-five (25) years, respectively.",
            "block_bbox": [
                372,
                573,
                911,
                716
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    372.0,
                    573.0
                ],
                [
                    911.0,
                    573.0
                ],
                [
                    911.0,
                    716.0
                ],
                [
                    372.0,
                    716.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) For an Employee whose Term of Employment is less than two (2) years, the amount of vacation to which otherwise eligible in accordance with this Article will be reduced by one-twelfth (1/2) for each full period of thirty (30) consecutive calendar days' absence or separation from the payroll occurring, or expected to occur, during the current calendar year (other than paid for absences due to sickness or accident disability). In the amount to be subtracted, fractions of one-half (1/2) day or less will be disregarded, and fractions of more than one-half (1/2) day will be considered as one (1) day. In computing any such period of absence, the absence will be considered as beginning with the first calendar day after the last day for which the Employee is paid.",
            "block_bbox": [
